## Information
Holiday setup can feel rushed, especially with pets or little ones nearby. The HOMCOM artificial Christmas tree eases that stress with auto-drop hinged branches that open faster, so decorating starts sooner. Flame-retardant PVC leaves add reassurance around busy family moments, while pet-friendly materials make this Xmas tree easier to welcome into everyday life. It helps your home feel festive, calmer and more family-ready
